Package: usb-ssh-devtool
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openssh-server, ufw, bash (>= 4.0)
Recommends: fail2ban
Maintainer: homelab <biranjan15@gmail.com>
Description: USB SSH Recovery & Access Devtool for hardened Ubuntu systems
 Installs a key-based SSH recovery agent on a secured Ubuntu machine.
 Generates an ED25519 keypair on first install, configures sshd, opens
 the firewall, and runs a watchdog systemd timer to keep SSH alive.
 Designed to be carried on a USB drive and installed on any Ubuntu 20.04+.
